{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the world of Urban Paranoia. As a tenant with a new lease agreement your mission is to pay rent by any means necessary. Explore the creepy randomly generated layouts of the sewers and area 51 bunker to find valuable items. It wont be easy however because you are not alone underground! You will encounter a variety of cryptid enemies each with unique behaviors and lore that will try to stop you. How many days can you and your friends survive?\u00a0 <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901840/extras/f5663da4df11d77c0265deccc9e0f202.avif?t=1757373868\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic sanity system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Your mind is just as fragile as your body, throughout your game you must manage your dynamic sanity meter. The lower it gets the more danger you will face from enemies along with creepy random hallucinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Your sanity will deteriorate as you mind is attacked by radio waves from 5G towers and mysterious stalkers who become more hostile as they push you towards insanity.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901840/extras/1619dcda3df3df755fcad56bcd7041c9.avif?t=1757373868\" width=400 height=400 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901840/extras/69bea69727da6f90543ea5d994a15fac.avif?t=1757373868\" width=400 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't have to make ends meet alone, get yourself some roommates to pay the bills! You and three other friends can struggle to makes ends meet with proximity chat.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901840/extras/277edfcbc922033a0c76abbaf55690a0.avif?t=1757373868\" data-has-big width=1560 height=846 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Darkweb</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Black Bay online market is your go to website to get medication, weapons and tools to make sure your rent is on time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901840/extras/0e814c86e386912f860455017c60c324.avif?t=1757373868\" data-has-big width=1560 height=882 /></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3901840?t=1757373868","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3901840?t=1757373868","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901840/66711523506f65de65fa7c91c05d4d116eaf3d7d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757373868","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901840/66711523506f65de65fa7c91c05d4d116eaf3d7d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757373868","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"contains graphic violence and drug/substance abuse."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the world of Urban Paranoia. As a tenant with a new lease agreement your mission is to pay rent by any means necessary. Explore the creepy randomly generated layouts of the sewers and area 51 bunker to find valuable items. It wont be easy however because you are not alone underground! You will encounter a variety of cryptid enemies each with unique behaviors and lore that will try to stop you. How many days can you and your friends survive?\u00a0 <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901840/extras/f5663da4df11d77c0265deccc9e0f202.avif?t=1757373868\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic sanity system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Your mind is just as fragile as your body, throughout your game you must manage your dynamic sanity meter. The lower it gets the more danger you will face from enemies along with creepy random hallucinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Your sanity will deteriorate as you mind is attacked by radio waves from 5G towers and mysterious stalkers who become more hostile as they push you towards insanity.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901840/extras/1619dcda3df3df755fcad56bcd7041c9.avif?t=1757373868\" width=400 height=400 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901840/extras/69bea69727da6f90543ea5d994a15fac.avif?t=1757373868\" width=400 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't have to make ends meet alone, get yourself some roommates to pay the bills! You and three other friends can struggle to makes ends meet with proximity chat.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901840/extras/277edfcbc922033a0c76abbaf55690a0.avif?t=1757373868\" data-has-big width=1560